### Get all roles
GET http://localhost:7070/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer INDSÆT_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### Get role by id
GET http://localhost:7070/api/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer INDSÆT_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### Get role by name
GET http://localhost:7070/api/roles/name/admin
Authorization: Bearer INDSÆT_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### Create admin-role
POST http://localhost:7070/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer INDSÆT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "admin"
}

### Update role by id
PUT http://localhost:7070/api/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer INDSÆT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "admin"
}

